# DurableSymbolStore canonical mutation script golden
# br-38cd93962: read-validate / write-publish split
# Each step emits one probe line of observable state.
# 'used' = storage_used (bytes); 'zone_objects' = list_zone(work).len();
# count(a1) = symbol_count for object 0xA1...; count(b2) = ditto for 0xB2...
#
# Load-bearing invariants visible in the diff:
#   1. each symbol contributes 192 bytes to used (128 data +
#      64 metadata overhead per Self::symbol_size). A drift in
#      this constant becomes visible as a per-row delta change.
#      Each object also contributes 262 bytes (256 bookkeeping +
#      6 zone identifier bytes), even before any symbols arrive.
#   2. idempotent duplicate put leaves used unchanged (zero double-count)
#      — visible as steps 02/03 producing identical lines.
#   3. delete_symbol releases the symbol's bytes; delete_object releases
#      its metadata and the sum of its remaining symbols.
#   4. failed validate (conflicting bytes) leaves state byte-identical
#      to pre-attempt — visible as steps 03/04 producing identical lines.
#   5. reopen-from-disk recovers the full applied state — step 10's
#      line MUST match step 09's line. Pre-fix the read-validate /
#      write-publish split could (under refactor) advance next_seq
#      on validate failure and corrupt the WAL — the reopen-floor
#      check is the only structural proof of 'no WAL gap'.

step 00 open                              
  used=     0  zone_objects=0  count(a1)=0  count(b2)=0
step 01 put_object_meta(a1, K=4)          
  used=   262  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=0  count(b2)=0
step 02 put_symbol(a1, esi=0, fill=AA)    
  used=   454  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=1  count(b2)=0
step 03 put_symbol(a1, esi=0, fill=AA) (dup)
  used=   454  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=1  count(b2)=0
step 04 put_symbol(a1, esi=0, fill=BB) (forged)
  used=   454  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=1  count(b2)=0
step 05 put_symbol(a1, esi=1, fill=CC)    
  used=   646  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=2  count(b2)=0
step 06 put_object_meta(b2, K=2)          
  used=   908  zone_objects=2  count(a1)=2  count(b2)=0
step 07 put_symbol(b2, esi=0, fill=DD)    
  used=  1100  zone_objects=2  count(a1)=2  count(b2)=1
step 08 delete_symbol(a1, esi=1)          
  used=   908  zone_objects=2  count(a1)=1  count(b2)=1
step 09 delete_object(a1)                 
  used=   454  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=0  count(b2)=1
step 10 reopen + probe (recovery floor)   
  used=   454  zone_objects=1  count(a1)=0  count(b2)=1
